4
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:43,820
To calculate volume of rectangular prism we take length times width then times height (same unit).

5
00:00:44,420 --> 00:01:05,870
Let V be volume of rectangular prism. a, b, c are three dimensions of rectangular prism.

6
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:19,820
We have: V = a x b x c

